  "title": "Honorary Chef: Taste of Memories",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Honorary Chef: Taste of Memories</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tutorial Quests\">Tutorial</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jinzhou\" title=\"Jinzhou\">Jinzhou</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Union_EXP\" title=\"Union EXP\"><img alt=\"Union EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Union EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Union_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0b/Item_Union_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240525121935\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 150</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 20</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stuffed_Flatbread_Recipe\" title=\"Stuffed Flatbread Recipe\"><img alt=\"Stuffed Flatbread Recipe\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Recipe.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Recipe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a5/Item_Recipe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240531221957\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Angelica_Tea_Recipe\" title=\"Angelica Tea Recipe\"><img alt=\"Angelica Tea Recipe\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Recipe.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Recipe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a5/Item_Recipe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240531221957\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 20,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mahe\" title=\"Mahe\">Mahe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Panhua\" title=\"Panhua\">Panhua</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Honorary Chef: Taste of Memories</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quest\" title=\"Tutorial Quest\">Tutorial Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Jinzhou\" title=\"Jinzhou\">Jinzhou</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Purchase the ingredients Panhua needs</li>\n<li>Deliver the ingredients to Panhua</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">You see Panhua comforting a crying girl. Maybe go up and ask what happened...</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Panhua:</b> Oh, don't cry, don't cry. Tell me what happened. Did someone pick on you?</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> Sob...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> What's the matter?</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Been crying for a while now. I can't get an answer out of her.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> She just came to buy <a href=\"/wiki/Spicy_Pulled_Chicken\" title=\"Spicy Pulled Chicken\">Spicy Pulled Chicken</a>, but the Fowl is already used up today.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> So I said, \"Come back tomorrow, I'll get the stuff and do prep.\" And she sat down and bawled.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> She's been like this for nearly 10 minutes now. I haven't gotten the slightest clue what she’s so sad about.</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> Sob...</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> I, I can't do anything right every day. I can't buy what I want to eat, I... *sobbing*</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> And now your crying even harder. Here, let me help you wipe those tears.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Well, you get the picture! If I could just go buy some fresh ingredients, I can give her the food she's craving for!</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> It's just that I have the intention to do it but I can't spare the time, she has to have someone to look after her, and the shop has to have someone to look after it...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> I'll help.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> I... Wow, thank you so much! I'll treat you to something nice when you're back!</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> For the ingredients of the Spicy Pulled Chicken, you can directly ask <a href=\"/wiki/Mahe\" title=\"Mahe\">Mahe</a>, we're all familiar.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Tell him I sent you and the bill's on me.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> I hope you won’t mind the hassle. I'll make sure to treat you with our speciality dishes here!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Mahe)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Purchase the ingredients Panhua needs</dd>\n<dd><b>Mahe:</b> Panhua? So she's finally willing to buy from my place, huh?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Actually...</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>You can tell Mahe in detail about the things you encountered in the Panhua Restaurant.</b></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Mahe:</b> I see. One moment please, I'll go get what you need real quick. Freshness guaranteed!</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Mahe handed you a large bag of ingredients, you can see the tender fowl in it. The ingredients in Mahe's convenience store are always fresh, which is reassuring.</b></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Panhua)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Bring the Ingredients to Panhua</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Let's see here... Cooking oil, chili peppers, chicken. Perfect, we've got everything! Thank you so much! Now it's my turn to shine!</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Panhua took your ingredients, and in a short while, a plate of Spicy Pulled Chicken was served.</b></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Panhua:</b> Here you go, sweetie. Dig in.</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> Let me taste it... Uh...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You're crying even harder.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Are you alright?</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Why are you crying again, honey? Not to your taste?</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> No, no, it's really delicious. Just too spicy...</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> As a child, I was always crying, and my grandpa would make pulled chicken to cheer me up.</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> He used to say that if I ate something spicy, all the bitterness of life would go away and there's no need to cry.</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> But now that I'm older, I don't cry as much. When my grandpa passed away, I didn't even shed a tear. I thought I'd lost the ability to cry...</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> But recently, I was under a lot of pressure and felt wronged, and I suddenly wanted to eat pulled chicken, but I couldn't find it anywhere. That's when I...</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> I'm really troubling you, but I just, I just miss my grandfather...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> It's okay.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> (Pat her on the shoulder)</dd>\n<dd><b>Girl:</b> Thank you so much, both of you. The chicken was delicious. I'll definitely be back for more.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> You can come by anytime, sweetie. Be sure to wear a big smile on your face next time!</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>The girl, wiping her tears, left with a smile.</b></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Panhua:</b> I'm glad you stopped by to help. Wouldn't have made the chicken for her in time without you.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> \"Do you often run into things like this?</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> As a restaurant owner, you inevitably come across situations like this. Life can be tough sometimes, and a good meal can make all the difference.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> That's why I started this place. When I saw that little girl crying, it broke my heart. Thanks for lending a hand today, it means a lot to me.</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Thank you so much for today. From now on, you can use the pots in my shop as you please. If you have any difficulties, don't hesitate to tell me!</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Look, the pot is right there. I have copied the recipe for Spicy Pulled Chicken for you. If you follow the recipe to do the cooking, I guarantee it will be delicious!</dd>\n<dd><b>Panhua:</b> Would you like to give it a try now? Here, I have some ingredients for you. There is some left, so you can make another dish!</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Honorary Chef: Taste of Memories</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">名誉厨师</span>: <span lang=\"zh-Hans\">回忆的味道</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">名譽主廚：回憶的味道</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji JA Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_JA_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Emoji_JA_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221804\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">名誉料理長</span>:<span lang=\"ja\">テイスト・オブ・メモリーズ</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji KO Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji KO Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_KO_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Emoji_KO_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221837\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">명예</span> <span lang=\"ko\">셰프</span>: <span lang=\"ko\">추억의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">맛</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji FR Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji FR Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_FR_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Emoji_FR_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221935\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;French</b></td><td>Chef honoraire&#160;: Goût des souvenirs</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji DE Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji DE Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_DE_Flag.png\" data-releva